    <string name="oem_battery_title">Isilondolozi sebhethri somkhiqizi</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_xiaomi">I-Xiaomi ingayimisa ngokuphelele i-app – bese kungafiki ama-alamu. Vula u-“Autostart” bese usetha i-Battery saver ibe ngu-“No restrictions”.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_samsung">I-Samsung ingafaka i-app ebuthongweni obujulile – bese kungafiki ama-alamu. Ngaphansi kwe-Battery › Background usage limits, yengeze ku-“Never sleeping apps”.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_huawei">I-Huawei/Honor ingayimisa i-app – bese kungafiki ama-alamu. Ngaphansi kwe-Battery › App launch, khetha “Manage manually” bese uvumela zonke izinketho.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_oneplus">I-OnePlus ingayimisa i-app – bese kungafiki ama-alamu. Vumela “Auto-launch” futhi, ngaphansi kwe-Battery usage, umsebenzi ongemuva.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_oppo">I-Oppo/Realme ingayimisa i-app – bese kungafiki ama-alamu. Vumela “Auto launch” futhi, ngaphansi kwe-Battery usage, umsebenzi ongemuva.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_vivo">I-Vivo ingayimisa i-app – bese kungafiki ama-alamu. Vumela “Autostart” futhi, ngaphansi kwe-Battery, ukusetshenziswa kwamandla amaningi ngemuva.</string>
